      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nRiverview House is a substantial five-bedroom semi-detached period residence extending to approximately 186 sq. m. (2,002 sq. ft.), ideally positioned less than a five-minute walk from Enniscorthy town centre and all its excellent amenities.\n\nDating back to the late 1800s, this charming home is bursting with character and offers an exciting opportunity for those seeking to restore and modernise a property of genuine architectural appeal. While the residence would benefit from refurbishment throughout, it retains many of its original period features including impressive ceiling heights, generously proportioned rooms, large feature sash-style windows with timber surrounds, and a striking entrance hallway with original staircase.\n\nThe spacious accommodation is thoughtfully laid out over two floors and includes five bedrooms, with the added benefit of two ground floor bedrooms, offering excellent flexibility for those requiring single-level living, guest accommodation or a home office. The bright living accommodation provides ample scope to create a wonderful family home while preserving the property's inherent period charm.\n\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a private southernly facing garden while to the front there are pleasant open views.\n\nProperties of this scale, character and town-centre convenience rarely come to the market. Whether you are searching for a distinctive family residence, an investment opportunity or a restoration project, Riverview House offers enormous potential."
      },
